DYNAMIC OCEAN MASK
---------------------
initializes the landmask:
% par.land_mask(newZ<100) = 0;

reducing the cutoff doesnt work for larger time incrementations
% par.land_mask(newZ<10) = 0;
0.05e1*par.year; works but 0.5e1*par.year; fails at the first iteration

so if it moves more than 10m per incrementation (happens esp at first iterations its very fast), a neg value of h is found → crashes

GCM input for ice elevation includes 0m at substellar pt

viscosity initialized by: 
% B=ones(par.ni,par.nj)*1e16*par.zMol/par.R;
zMol has values of 0m at substellar point so some values of b are set to 0 

LINEARIZED MODEL
---------------------
B(i,j)=(h(i,j)/par.R)*mean(AA)*par.shear_factor; 
viscosity vertically averaged linearized model calculates viscosity using an 
arbitrary shear stress parameter instead of calculating the whole matrix





